/h3>\n<p>\tThey will always attack the weakest Player they see and will switch back quickly even if <a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenged</a> by an <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Elite Knight</a>.<br/><br/>A pirate marauder attacks in melee range. A pirate marauder will retreat at 20  (9.52%, red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThey rarely use their weak distance attack so <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can kill them easily from afar. Also, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and Mages shouldn't have much difficulty except to watch out for being drawn into larger groups (especially by stronger pirates that often wait in the second row) and surrounded.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 81,129 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-40</td>\n<td>12.1</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"77.597407\" style=\"text-align:center;\">78%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td